            {
                "entry_id": "0ccbf5f3-427c-31a2-9896-020b7eea1d4d",
                "word": "bluegrass",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7af2a941-929d-3b72-ae1e-e3afc53f40ae",
                        "entry_id": "0ccbf5f3-427c-31a2-9896-020b7eea1d4d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A subgenre of country music with roots in Scots-Irish Appalachian folk music, blues, and jazz and characterized by banjos, fiddles, acoustic guitars, dobros, and mandolins; but containing no drums, electric guitars, pianos or other keyboard or wind instruments; using a bass fiddle to carry its rhythm."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "88632b29-f688-4aa9-bab9-ead48d0b10fe",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ccbf5f3-427c-31a2-9896-020b7eea1d4d",
                        "source_sense_id": "7af2a941-929d-3b72-ae1e-e3afc53f40ae",
                        "source_sense_description": "style of country music",
                        "target_lang_word": "bluegrass",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bluegrass",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ab382b8-e347-3f3b-ae12-0f458570f4fc",
                                        "entry_id": "3b7a5193-e9ed-3d4b-9665-2e8cca8e5b3e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "country muziek uit de staat Kentucky"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdfef183-33f8-4c52-b242-29c5a6a28884",
                                                "sense_id": "0ab382b8-e347-3f3b-ae12-0f458570f4fc",
                                                "text": ",,Hij houdt van hardrock, hij houdt van Led Zeppelin en bluegrass muziek, dus mijn muziek zit daar ergens tussenin. Hij vindt het niet vreselijk, maar hij doet er niet alles aan om mijn platen te luisteren, laten we het zo zeggen”, grapt de 73-jarige zangeres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45ea7303-f2fa-48b0-80d5-5502996466ec",
                                                "sense_id": "0ab382b8-e347-3f3b-ae12-0f458570f4fc",
                                                "text": "In het park staan 16 brouwerijen die samen meer dan 200 speciaalbieren meenemen. Ook is er muziek zoals bluegrass, boogie en rockabilly, leer je alles wat je maar wilt weten over bier tijdens biercolleges en is er een ruim aanbod aan eten."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "16401de0-2411-4af5-9483-e05fb5d4e011",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ccbf5f3-427c-31a2-9896-020b7eea1d4d",
                        "source_sense_id": "7af2a941-929d-3b72-ae1e-e3afc53f40ae",
                        "source_sense_description": "style of country music",
                        "target_lang_word": "bluegrass",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bluegrass",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d5464090-4435-30e7-836a-5a9b4b8d789b",
                                        "entry_id": "64d959d5-d3c1-3c77-8d6d-e0152e04bdba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Style musical d'origine américaine qui constitue une branche de la musique country."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfdacbe2-21e6-47fa-a6ae-1bfdb67aaf81",
                                                "sense_id": "d5464090-4435-30e7-836a-5a9b4b8d789b",
                                                "text": "Ils se feront funky ou plus pop dans la rumba, nostalgiques dans le bluegrass, intimes dans le folk, plus swing avec les violons et les cuivres en avant, bluesy sur un rythme cubain et plus free à la fin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f452c016-1f8f-4b67-ae2f-8e19774544e9",
                        "source_entry_id": "0ccbf5f3-427c-31a2-9896-020b7eea1d4d",
                        "source_sense_id": "7af2a941-929d-3b72-ae1e-e3afc53f40ae",
                        "source_sense_description": "style of country music",
                        "target_lang_word": "Bluegrass",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Bluegrass",
